data/
# Company logos are per-deployment and live in the persistent data/ volume
# (rehydrated into public/ on boot). Keeping them out of the repo/image stops
# one company's logo leaking into a new service created from the same repo.
public/logo-ispl.png
public/logo-asp.png
# Crash dumps. A headless Chromium that dies mid-render drops an ELF core in
# the working directory — hundreds of MB each, and they sail straight past a
# review into a commit that GitHub then rejects at 100 MB.
core
*.core
